<title>USA: NatWest lowers EPS estimate on Coleman.</title>
<headline>NatWest lowers EPS estimate on Coleman.</headline>
<text>
<p>- NatWest Securities analyst Susan Gallagher expects to lower EPS estimates on Coleman Co Inc to around $0.75-$0.80 a share for 1996 from $0.93 and for 1997 to &quot;probably&quot; go to $1.10 a share from $1.20.</p>
<p>- Maintains &quot;hold&quot; rating</p>
<p>- Sales decline in Japan probably due to general economic conditions, but analysts will be keeping a close eye on that market.</p>
</text>
